{"4560870": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ガッチャ！サバイバー", "steam_appid": 4560870, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The era of dodging bullets is over.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This roguelike action game blends auto-attack survival with risk-reward attribute switching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between Light and Dark to absorb enemy bullets and charge energy.<br>When fully charged, unleash powerful character-specific burst attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Absorb or evade—<br>a single decision can turn the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you unlock more characters, the range of skills available during runs expands.<br>Your progression directly increases your strategic options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A roguelike adventure starring charming, colorful characters.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique fusion of shooting and roguelike gameplay where you switch polarity to absorb or evade enemy attacks and unleash powerful skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive using player movement and automatic skills,<br>while navigating and absorbing waves of incoming bullets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you break through the overwhelming hordes and relentless bullet storms?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Polarity Switching</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy attacks are divided into two types: <strong>Light (white)</strong> and <strong>Dark (black)</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch polarity instantly with a single button.<br>Absorb attacks of the same type, but take damage from the opposite type.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4560870/extras/2adf9c92dce6ae9e222f4827a6937a8b.avif?t=1786970921\" width=908 height=530 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4560870/extras/0b79bccf4f85c88e578a2cafd12425d5.poster.avif?t=1786970921\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4560870/extras/0b79bccf4f85c88e578a2cafd12425d5.webm?t=1786970921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4560870/extras/0b79bccf4f85c88e578a2cafd12425d5.mp4?t=1786970921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Burst Activation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By continuously absorbing enemy attacks, you can unleash a powerful, character-specific Burst.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge through incoming attacks, then wipe out enemies with your Burst!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4560870/extras/0dfdf23fe91aefc8c78f85abcb757564.poster.avif?t=1786970921\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4560870/extras/0dfdf23fe91aefc8c78f85abcb757564.webm?t=1786970921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4560870/extras/0dfdf23fe91aefc8c78f85abcb757564.mp4?t=1786970921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The era of dodging bullets is over.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This roguelike action game blends auto-attack survival with risk-reward attribute switching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between Light and Dark to absorb enemy bullets and charge energy.<br>When fully charged, unleash powerful character-specific burst attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Absorb or evade—<br>a single decision can turn the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you unlock more characters, the range of skills available during runs expands.<br>Your progression directly increases your strategic options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A roguelike adventure starring charming, colorful characters.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique fusion of shooting and roguelike gameplay where you switch polarity to absorb or evade enemy attacks and unleash powerful skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive using player movement and automatic skills,<br>while navigating and absorbing waves of incoming bullets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you break through the overwhelming hordes and relentless bullet storms?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Polarity Switching</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy attacks are divided into two types: <strong>Light (white)</strong> and <strong>Dark (black)</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch polarity instantly with a single button.<br>Absorb attacks of the same type, but take damage from the opposite type.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4560870/extras/2adf9c92dce6ae9e222f4827a6937a8b.avif?t=1786970921\" width=908 height=530 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4560870/extras/0b79bccf4f85c88e578a2cafd12425d5.poster.avif?t=1786970921\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4560870/extras/0b79bccf4f85c88e578a2cafd12425d5.webm?t=1786970921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.ste